ram will be each week of the 2026 college football season.","published":"2026-11-25T15:16:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49783645/where-college-gameday-2026-schedule-locations-recaps","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: USC favored at UCLA, Texas double-digit faves at Texas A&M","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for UCLA-USC, Texas A&M-Texas and more.","published":"2026-11-25T15:00:51.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50571004/2026-college-football-week-13-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Manuel to remain Michigan AD until new hire is found","description":"Warde Manuel has agreed to stay in the job as Michigan's athletic director until the school finds a new athletic director, sources told ESPN on Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T16:12:47.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50592920/sources-manuel-stay-job-new-michigan-ad-hired","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Dan Wetzel","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4875126/horace-lockett","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horace_Lockett"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Horace Lockett","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horace_Lockett","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:38:20Z","intro":"Horace Lockett (born July 26, 2004) is an American college football defensive tackle for the UCF Knights. He previously played for the Georgia Tech Yellow Jackets.","sections":[{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman at Georgia Tech in 2022, Lockett made three appearances. He saw more playing time in the 2023 season and tallied 25 tackles along with 2.5 tackles-for-loss (TFLs) and a forced fumble. However, a hand injury resulted in Lockett being kept out of every game during the 2024 season. The following year, he transferred to the UCF Knights. With UCF, Lockett won a starting role and posted 13 tackles, three TFLs, a sack and two pass breakups. However, a pectoral injury ended his season after four games. Lockett returned for a final season with the Knights in 2026."}]}}